flf2a$ 6 5 16 15 7 0 0 0
Frozen copy of the ASCII block (U+0020-U+007E) of the FIGlet `standard` font,
used as an independent reference by scripts/check-ascii-art-text.mjs.
Upstream: https://github.com/patorjk/figlet.js/blob/master/fonts/Standard.flf
Original face: Glenn Chappell and Ian Chai, 1993.
Rows keep FIGlet endmarks (@) and hardblanks, so the check script runs a real
FLF parser over this file rather than a bespoke format.
Do not reformat: trailing columns are the glyph widths.
